{"strongs": "H8203", "word": "שְׁפַטְיָה(וּׅ", "translit": "she.phat.yah", "root": "שפח", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "judged, vindicated", "definition": "שְׁפַטְיָה(וּׅ proper name, masculine ( ׳ י judged, vindicated ); — usu, Σαφατια ( ς ): 1. יָה -: \\ \\ a. fifth son of David 2Sam 3:4 = 1Chr 3:3 ( Σαβατεια , A Σαφαθια , ᵐ5 L Σαφατιας ). \\ \\ b. contemporary of Jeremiah Jer 38:1 ( B Σαφανιας ). \\ \\ c. man of Judah Neh 11:4 . \\ \\ d. chiefs of families of restoration: (1) Ezra 2:4 = Neh 7:9 ; Ezra 8:8 (2) Ezra 2:57 = Neh 7:59 . \\ \\ e. Benjamite 1Chr 9:8 . 2. יָהוּ -: \\ \\ a. son of Jehosh. 2Chr 21:2 . \\ \\ b. hero of David 1Chr 12:5 . \\ \\ c. Simeonite 1Chr 27:16 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8960')\">BDB8960</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8203')\">H8203</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8959')\">BDB8959</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8961')\">BDB8961</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁפַטְיָה(וּׅ</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>judged, vindicated</highlight>); — usu, <grk>Σαφατια</grk>(<grk>ς</grk>): <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>יָה</bdbheb>-: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> fifth son of David <ref ref=\"2Sam 3:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,3,4)\">2Sam 3:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,3)\">1Chr 3:3</ref> (<grk>Σαβατεια</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink>A</reflink></lookup> <grk>Σαφαθια</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <grk>Σαφατιας</grk>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> contemporary of Jeremiah <ref ref=\"Jer 38:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,1)\">Jer 38:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('B')\"><reflink>B</reflink></lookup> <grk>Σαφανιας</grk>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> man of Judah <ref ref=\"Neh 11:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,4)\">Neh 11:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> chiefs of families of restoration: (1) <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:4\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,4)\">Ezra 2:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,9)\">Neh 7:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:8\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,8)\">Ezra 8:8</ref> (2) <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:57\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"57\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"57\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,57)\">Ezra 2:57</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:59\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"59\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"59\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,59)\">Neh 7:59</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> Benjamite <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,8)\">1Chr 9:8</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>יָהוּ</bdbheb>-: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> son of Jehosh. <ref ref=\"2Chr 21:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,2)\">2Chr 21:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> hero of David <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,5)\">1Chr 12:5</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> Simeonite <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,16)\">1Chr 27:16</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 3:4", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 3, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "1Chr 3:3", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Jer 38:1", "book": "JER", "chapter": 38, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Neh 11:4", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezra 2:4", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 2, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Neh 7:9", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 7, "verse"